#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:10
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_START_OE_ACID\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic Growth is a relatively unknown faction. However, what isn't "
"unknown is how dangerous it is."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:11
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_START_OE_ACID\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"This nebula is home to the Acidic Growth. It's still unknown whether it's a "
"singular almost omnipresent entity or a hive mind of sorts, but you probably"
" don't wanna be on their bad side."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:12
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_START_OE_ACID\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You're told the Acidic Growth has expanded into this nebula. Unfortunately, "
"only the Orchids are welcome in Acidic space."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:13
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_START_OE_ACID\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"Not much is known about how the Acidic Growth lives and spends its time. "
"Perhaps you'll find out. Question is, if you'll be lucky enough to survive "
"to tell the tale."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:14
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_START_OE_ACID\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic Growth formed within a nebula like this. Although able to survive"
" naked in the nebula, the Acidic Growth has created its own ships and "
"technology in order to interact with the wider universe."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:29
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"START_OE_ACID\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:35
msgid "data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You're hailed by an Acidic vessel. \"You, outsider. Your intentions, we do "
"not know. Potential threat to Acidic Growth. Proof, you're not? Otherwise, "
"extermination.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:37
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Fight your way through!"

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:39
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You mute the ship and prepare for combat."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:42
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:48
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Convince it you only have good intentions."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:50
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "The Acidic Growth recognises your donation and lets you pass."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:57
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\"]/text"
msgstr "(Positive Gathering-Growth reputation) Request entry."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:59
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\"]/event/text"
msgstr "The Acidic Growth recognizes you as an ally. You're free to enter."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:63
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_worker\"]/text"
msgstr "(Acidic Worker) Enter freely."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:65
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_worker\"]/event/text"
msgstr "The Acidic Growth is welcoming of itself. You're free to enter."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:69
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_soldier\"]/text"
msgstr "(Acidic Soldier) Enter freely."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:71
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_soldier\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic Growth is welcoming of itself. Once they notice your crew is one "
"of the higher ranks, they also donate some supplies and note you as a known "
"ally."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:77
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid\"]/text"
msgstr "(Orchid Crew) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:79
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your Orchid hails the Acidic vessel, however before they can say anything "
"they receive a response. \"One of the trusted, on board. We welcome you. Our"
" space, yours.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:83
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid_caretaker\"]/text"
msgstr "(Caretaker Crew) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:85
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid_caretaker\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your Orchid hails the Acidic vessel, however before they can say anything "
"they receive a response. \"One of the trusted, on board. We welcome you. Our"
" space, yours.\" Seeing as your Orchid is a Caretaker under Grand Gardener, "
"they also note you as a known ally."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:90
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid_praetor\"]/text"
msgstr "(Praetor Crew) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:92
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid_praetor\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Your Praetor hails the Acidic vessel, however before they can say anything "
"they receive a response. \"One of the trusted, on board. Reason, diplomacy? "
"Please accept donation.\" You are free to enter."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:98
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"unique_mayeb\"]/text"
msgstr "(Mayeb) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:100
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"unique_mayeb\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You put Mayeb on comms, however before she can say anything she receives a "
"response. \"Grand Gardener. We recognize you, ally. Your voice, for us, "
"beautiful. Please accept donation.\" You are free to enter."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:106
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"unique_tyerel\"]/text"
msgstr "(Ty E'rel) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:108
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"unique_tyerel\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Ty steps forward, volunteering to talk with the Acidic Growth. \"I am Ty "
"E'rel. You should know that attacking this vessel would be an act of war. I "
"suggest you provide entry, as per Gathering-Growth agreement Orchids are "
"free to pass through Acidic Growth's space and vice versa.\" The Soldier on "
"screen apologizes and gives you some supplies before you go."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:114
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"mind\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Mind Control) It's hard to mind control something you're not even sure has "
"a mind, atleast one small enough to control."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:118
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"cloaking\"]/text"
msgstr "(Cloaking) Cloak and try to escape."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:122
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"engines\"]/text"
msgstr "(Adv. Engines) Try to escape the guard."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:126
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"pilot\"]/text"
msgstr "(Adv. Piloting) Activate the auto-pilot to try and escape."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:138
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID_DESTROY\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have defeated the Acidic guard. Whatever might have been in its cargo "
"has for certain been destroyed, but you can at least salvage some supplies "
"from the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:141
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID_DESTROY\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:146
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID_DEADCREW\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have defeated the Acidic guard. Without any of the Acidic Growth on "
"board to stop you, you can investigate their cargo. You find a weapon to "
"bring back to the ship, and move on to scrap their hull."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:150
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID_DEADCREW\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:163
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID_FOLLOWUP\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"By killing the Acidic guard, you have no doubt caused them to dispatch "
"reinforcements to track you down. Watch your step as you explore the sector."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:172
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID_FOLLOWUP\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:176
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACID_FOLLOWUP\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

