msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:204
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_LIGHT_REINFORCEMENTS_OE_ACID\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic Growth has not taken your less than friendly entry to the sector "
"well and it appears it has dispatched a ship specifically to stop you."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:209
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_LIGHT_REINFORCEMENTS_OE_ACID\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:221
msgid "data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"START_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"It's risky to venture this deep into Acidic territory. The Acidic Growth "
"originated from this sector, and it's very defensive of it. The methods to "
"get in that'd work on its newer territories won't work here."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:228
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"START_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:234
msgid "data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The Elite guard here sends you a brief, to-the-point message. \"Outsider. "
"This space, is ours. Turn back.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:236
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Fight your way through."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:238
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You silence communications and prepare to attack."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:241
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:247
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Suggest a monetary bribe."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:249
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Security, is absolute. Extermination, required.\" It seems like you can't "
"sweeten those guys."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:252
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:258
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\"]/text"
msgstr "(Positive Gathering-Growth reputation) Request entry."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:260
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You've made quite a name among Acidic Growth... even if it's not exactly "
"clear if it's different consciousnesses or all just one, united whole. It "
"lets you in."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:264
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_worker\"]/text"
msgstr "(Acidic Worker) Request Entry."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:266
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_worker\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"It takes a bit for the guard to answer. \"Us, on unknown ship? Can't trust. "
"Hostage, possibility. Extermination, required. Us, collected after.\" Right,"
" those guys can survive in outer space. You can't, so you better start "
"fighting back."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:269
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_worker\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:275
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_soldier\"]/text"
msgstr "(Acidic Soldier) Request Entry."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:277
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_soldier\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"It takes a bit for the guard to answer. \"Us, on unknown ship? High rank. "
"Hostage, possibility, minimal. Excuse us.\" You're free to enter, and the "
"Growth notes you as a known ally."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:282
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid\"]/text"
msgstr "(Orchid Crew) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:284
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"It takes a bit for the guard to answer. \"Ally, Orchid? Unknown ship. Ally, "
"maybe not. Pirate operation, possible. Extermination, required.\" You "
"prepare to defend yourself."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:287
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:293
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid_caretaker\"]/text"
msgstr "(Caretaker Crew) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:295
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid_caretaker\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"It takes a bit for the guard to answer. \"Ally, Orchid? Unknown ship, but..."
" under Grand Gardener, means ally. Excuse us.\" You're free to enter."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:299
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid_praetor\"]/text"
msgstr "(Praetor Crew) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:301
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"orchid_praetor\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"It takes a bit for the guard to answer. \"Ally, Orchid? High rank. "
"Diplomatic mission? Excuse us.\" You're free to enter, and the Growth notes "
"you as a known ally to provide safer travel."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:306
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"unique_mayeb\"]/text"
msgstr "(Mayeb) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:308
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"unique_mayeb\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Mayeb goes on comms, \"Our intentions are peaceful. We just want to pass through the sector. I hope you recognize me; I'd like to avoid confrontation.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Grand Gardener? Welcome, ally. Excuse us. Please accept donation.\" You're free to enter."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:317
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"unique_tyerel\"]/text"
msgstr "(Ty E'rel) Request passage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:319
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"unique_tyerel\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"Ty goes on comms, \"My name is Ty E'rel. I suggest that you do not attack "
"this vessel, or the Gathering-Growth Alliance might face... difficulties. We"
" are just passing through.\" The Growth apologises and sends some supplies "
"over."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:325
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"mind\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Mind Control) It's hard to mind control something you're not even sure has "
"a mind, atleast one small enough to control."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:329
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"cloaking\"]/text"
msgstr "(Cloaking) Cloak and try to escape."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:333
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"engines\"]/text"
msgstr "(Adv. Engines) Try to escape the guard."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:337
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME\"]/choice[@req=\"pilot\"]/text"
msgstr "(Adv. Piloting) Activate the auto-pilot to try and escape."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:412
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME_DESTROY\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have defeated the Acidic guard. Whatever might have been in their cargo "
"has for certain been destroyed, but you can at least salvage some supplies "
"from the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:415
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME_DESTROY\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:420
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GUARD_OE_ACIDHOME_DEADCREW\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You have defeated the Acidic guard. Without the Acidic Growth on board to "
