#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:851
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"This beacon is blasted with advertisements of an emergency sale at a nearby "
"store. The ads seem enticing, but desperate."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:853
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Approach the store."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:855
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You hail the store, and a young male human in questionable attire comes on "
"screen. \"Heeey, buddy! Welcome to my store! I got everything for your acid "
"needs - acid injectors, acid extractors, acid tubes, and even acid breakers!"
" Everything at half off, of course, just as advertised.\" He smiles weakly."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:857
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Do you have anything... more useful?"

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:859
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Ah, shucks.\" He lowers his head. \"I hoped you wouldn't be one of those "
"battle-freaks.\" The man is silent for a moment. \"But yes, yes, I do. Not a"
" lot, though - sold most stuff to buy the acid equipment the moment I found "
"out there's an acid nebula here.\" He scratches his head and his voice grows"
" in pitch. \"I miiight have misunderstood the kind of 'acid' this nebula was"
" made of, so I'm just trying to get the equipment sold as quickly as "
"possible. Still, I do have the usual wares. Here, take a look.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:866
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Ignore the store."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:868
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "You decide that dubious sales aren't for you."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:870
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:874
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID_CIVILIAN\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:885
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr ""
"An unvisited location. This beacon is located within the Acidic Growth, "
"which may be detrimental to the health of your ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:886
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/beaconType/visitedTooltip"
msgstr "Explored location. Nothing left of interest."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:887
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/beaconType/undiscoveredTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:890
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"You arrive at a beacon shrouded in a thick acidic nebula. The only "
"discernable thing is a flickering light not far away, which also seems to be"
" where a hail is currently coming from."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:892
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Hear them out."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:894
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"This is an advertisement. Urgent sale. Acidic Growth equipment. All "
"organisms and/or machines are welcome. This is the end of the "
"advertisement.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:896
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "What do you have?"

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:900
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"(Positive Gathering-Growth reputation) Ask if they have anything special."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:902
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Renegade. Friend of the Growth. Take weapon. On the house.\" The vessel "
"transfers you a free weapon."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:908
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Doesn't seem like you see much business."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:910
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The ship takes a while to respond. \"More true than preferred. Long time. No"
" customers. Need to go to the shipyard. Instead waiting.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:912
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Maybe we can help."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:914
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"You can help. Help advertise.\" The vessel transfers you a list of "
"possible advertisements - each one less appealing than the last."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:916
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Let's just wing this."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:918
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You spend a while beaming various types of advertisements around - from "
"infomercials on the advantages of Acidic weaponry, to thinly veiled threats "
"of violence to anyone who doesn't stop to shop."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:921
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:923
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"With the more gentle ad ideas proving more reliable, the Growth's store gets a couple of customers, which is a couple more than it did without your intervention. Other ideas, such as death threats and a store-themed cover of a popular song, didn't work out as well, although one customer did find their way to the shop after an especially swear-filled ad about the dangers of not having enough guns.\n"
"\n"
"The Growth thanks you for dedicating this time to help it, and offers you a reward for your troubles."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:929
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"0\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:935
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"-9999\"]/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:937
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"-9999\"]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"But no matter what you try, be it singing your lungs out on the mic or getting on your knees on a passing vessel's vidscreens, no one comes to the shop. Most explain their refusal with you having accumulated a sort of notoriousness around these parts, and one guy claiming he would've definitely shopped \"if your mug wasn't so ugly\".\n"
"\n"
"Still, despite your failure, the Growth decides that your efforts are still commendable, and offers to forgive some of your sins in exchange."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:943
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[@req=\"rep_comb_oe_acid_orchid\""
" and @lvl=\"-9999\"]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:951
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Can't spare the time, sorry."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:953
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[1]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Understandable. Regrettable.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:960
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Tough."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:962
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[3]/event/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "The vessel doesn't respond to the remark."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:969
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[4]/text"
msgstr "No thank you."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:971
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[4]/event/text"
msgstr "You decide to return to the beacon."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:973
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[4]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:977
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/event/choice[4]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:985
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "The sooner we get out - the better."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:987
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You decide that straying away from the beacon in such a low vision "
"environment is a bad idea."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:989
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:993
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_ACIDIC_STOREEVENT_OE_ACID\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1002
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_TRANSPORT_LOOT\"]/escape/text"
msgstr "They look like they don't want to fight. They are trying to escape."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1013
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/beaconType/unvisitedTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1014
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/beaconType/visitedTooltip"
msgstr "Explored location. Nothing left of interest."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1015
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/beaconType/undiscoveredTooltip"
msgstr "An unvisited location."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1018
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"This beacon hosts an Acidic transport. It's safe to bet the ship is most "
"likely carrying some special tech. If you can kill the acidic growth "
"onboard, the cargo will be yours."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1021
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Demand the surrender of the goods."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1023
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "You prepare to secure the cargo by force."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1029
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Avoid the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1031
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "The ship stays outside your weapons range, and eventually jumps away."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1033
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Do something onboard the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1037
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_TRANSPORT_OE_ACID_LOOT\"]/choice[2]/event/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Do nothing."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1044
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"TRANSPORT_CAPTURE_OE_ACID\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"The crew is dead, leaving you with the ship. Its cargo is yours for the "
"taking. Aboard is the special tech you expected, which you bring back to "
"your ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1064
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OE_ACID\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"As the wreck drifts apart you can just about make out the drifting clouds of"
" gas formally making up the Acidic Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1065
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OE_ACID\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"As the wreck breaks apart you wonder if the scattered fragments of the "
"Acidic Growth will ever make it back to their nebulas."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1066
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OE_ACID\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You wonder how long it takes a formless cloud of gas to construct a "
"spaceship. If the Acidic Growth could be angry, it would probably be angry "
"with you right now."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1067
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OE_ACID\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"Another Acidic vessel destroyed, and another piece of the Acidic Growth "
"stranded."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1068
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OE_ACID\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"Someday the Acidic Growth may reach out to form an alliance with the "
"Federation, you'll just have to hope it forgets about all the ships you've "
"destroyed."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1069
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DESTROYED_OE_ACID\"]/text[6]"
msgstr ""
"You can't help but feel sorry for those you've killed, even if they may or "
"may not be alive."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1072
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DESTROYED_OE_ACID_ACIDGUN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"To your surprise, one of the natively built Acidic weapons survived the "
"explosion. It's a little crisp from the explosion but with a few repairs you"
" can salvage it."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1090
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OE_ACID\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"You wonder if the Acidic Growth will know of the slaughter you've committed "
"here. Either way, this wreck is still full of scrap."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1091
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OE_ACID\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"Now that Acidic Growth's crew are but fragments diffused about the ship, you"
" get to scrapping."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1092
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OE_ACID\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"You thought you would become numb to the guilt after enough murders, but you"
" have yet to experience this."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1093
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OE_ACID\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic ship has been rid of crew. The moral part of you hopes that "
"killing an Acidic Growth mech doesn't count as murder."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1094
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_DEAD_CREW_OE_ACID\"]/text[5]"
msgstr ""
"You reassure yourself that the crew of this ship can feel neither pain nor "
"fear as you strip their vessel of anything useful."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1097
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DEAD_CREW_OE_ACID_ACIDGUN\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"Now emptied of crew, you find one of the natively built Acidic weapons on "
"board. You take it back with you before scrapping the ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1106
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_ESCAPE_OE_ACID\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic ship powers up its engines and swerves away from you. It's trying"
" to escape!"

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1107
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_ESCAPE_OE_ACID\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"You detect high spikes in engine power on the Acidic ship. It's trying to "
"escape."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1120
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_GOTAWAY_OE_ACID\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic ship escapes. To be honest, you're a little glad, hopefully in "
"the future the Acidic Growth won't try to obliterate you either."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1121
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_GOTAWAY_OE_ACID\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic ship jumps away. You pickup some residue gas clouds in the area, "
"you wonder if there are any fragments of the acidic growth out there."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1122
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_GOTAWAY_OE_ACID\"]/text[3]"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic ship's engine power spikes even higher and the ship jumps away."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1125
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"GOTAWAY_OE_ACID_REMAINS\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"As the Acidic ship jumps away you notice a trail of scrap left behind from "
"the broken ship. At least you'll have something to scrap."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1132
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"SURRENDER_OE_ACID\"]/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Accept its surrender."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1136
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"SURRENDER_OE_ACID\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_acid_worker\"]/text"
msgstr "(Acidic Worker) Negotiate a different deal."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1148
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OE_ACID\"]/text[1]"
msgstr ""
"A monotone voice requests you to stop firing in return for some supplies."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1149
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OE_ACID\"]/text[2]"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic ship surrenders. They offer some supplies if you'll let it live."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1150
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OE_ACID\"]/text[3]"
msgstr "\"The offer is satisfactory. Please accept it.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1151
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//textList[@name=\"TEXT_SURRENDER_OE_ACID\"]/text[4]"
msgstr ""
"\"Stop firing. You will receive reward.\" It appears the ship is "
"surrendering."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1162
msgid "data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_TEST_FIGHT\"]/text"
msgstr "TEST."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1165
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_ACID_TEST_FIGHT\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1227
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/surrender/text"
msgstr ""
"The station desperately hails you. \"Alright, alright! We'll release the "
"Growth. Just stop firing!\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1229
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/surrender/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Stop firing."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1232
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/surrender/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "The Orchid sighs. \"Damn it all... Oh, demotion, here I go...\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1234
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/surrender/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1236
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/surrender/choice[1]/event/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"While the Orchid station transports all the tanks of Growth back to the "
"Acidic ship, the latter contacts you again. \"Outsider, gratitude. Orchids -"
" allies. You - ally. Future negotiation, with allies, possible. Accept "
"this.\" Acidic Workers carry over a large amount of scrap."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1244
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/surrender/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "No second chances."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1246
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/surrender/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You continue firing on the station. The Growth will probably be fine, but "
"those Orchids deserve it."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1251
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/destroyed/text"
msgstr ""
"The station explodes, sending Acidic gases everywhere! You try to fly away, "
"but still get caught up in it; thankfully, the damage is not severe."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1256
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Contact the Acidic Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1258
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/destroyed/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Growth doesn't seem pleased - if not by tone, at least by words. "
"\"Outsider. Orchids, allies, gone? You, not an ally.\" They cut comms. At "
"least you can salvage the station's wreck."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1266
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/deadCrew/text"
msgstr ""
"The Orchids are dead, and the station is left empty - only containing tanks "
"with Acidic Growth inside. You scrap what you can."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1269
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Contact the Acidic Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1271
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_ORCHID_RESEARCH\"]/deadCrew/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The Growth doesn't seem pleased - if not by tone, at least by words. "
"\"Outsider. Orchids, allies, gone? You, not an ally.\" They cut comms. "
"Nothing to do but move on."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1283
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//triggeredEvent[@name=\"NEBULA_OE_ACID_WEAPON_TEST_COMPLETE_TRIGGER\"]/triggeredEventBox/tooltip"
msgstr ""
"The testing session will end after this much time. Do not attack the ship!"

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1293
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"OE_CEALAFORMER_TEST_FAIL\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"They did not take kindly to that attack, they've activated the rest of their"
" weapons!"

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1299
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CEALAFORMER\"]/surrender/text"
msgstr ""
"You receive a hail from the Coalition ship amidst the battle. \"Idiot! Do "
"not dessstroy it!\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1302
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CEALAFORMER\"]/destroyed/text"
msgstr ""
"Seeing as you destroyed your target, Acidic ships jump away, and the RUES "
"captain is furious. \"You moron! You cossst me my promotion! Do you even "
"know how much paperwork I'll have to do? I hate paper! Why are we still "
"using it?!\" They jump away, too, leaving you with a wreck. Scrapping it is."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1306
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CEALAFORMER\"]/deadCrew/text"
msgstr ""
"Seeing as your target is neutralized, Acidic ships jump away, and the RUES "
"captain is pleased.\"Great! Great. I'll contact othersss now to come "
"collect. Your payment, of courssse... And, now that i think of it, could you"
" take me with you? I'd hate doing paperwork after all that. Why do we even "
"ussse paper? Ssstill? I hate paper.\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1309
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CEALAFORMER\"]/deadCrew/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "Accept them into your crew."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1311
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CEALAFORMER\"]/deadCrew/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"\"Wonderfull. I hope thisss doesssn't count asss dessserting...\" The black-"
"clothed Slug comes aboard. You prepare to jump."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1316
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CEALAFORMER\"]/deadCrew/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Decline."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1318
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CEALAFORMER\"]/deadCrew/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr "\"Ah damn. Well, sssee you never.\" You prepare to jump."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1326
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_REFUGEE\"]/destroyed/text"
msgstr "The Acidic ship breaks apart and you salvage what you can."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1329
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_REFUGEE\"]/destroyed/choice/text"
msgstr "Contact the refugee ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1331
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_REFUGEE\"]/destroyed/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The refugee ship claims they didn't realize this was territory belonging to "
"the Acidic Growth. As a gesture of good will (and seeing how effectively you"
" dispatched the enemy ship), they offer up what supplies they can spare."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1337
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_REFUGEE\"]/deadCrew/text"
msgstr ""
"The Acidic ship, now out of control of the Acidic Growth, provides easy "
"salvage."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1340
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_REFUGEE\"]/deadCrew/choice/text"
msgstr "Contact the refugee ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1342
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_REFUGEE\"]/deadCrew/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"The refugee ship claims they didn't realize this was territory belonging to "
"the Acidic Growth. As a gesture of good will (and seeing how effectively you"
" dispatched the enemy ship), they offer up what supplies they can spare."

