"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CARETAKER_FIGHT\"]/deadCrew/choice[2]/text"
msgstr "Finish salvaging the ship and forget about the nursery."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1377
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CARETAKER_FIGHT\"]/deadCrew/choice[2]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You ignore the room and salvage the rest of the vessel, those kids will be "
"fine, right?"

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1380
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CARETAKER_FIGHT\"]/deadCrew/choice[2]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1386
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CARETAKER_FIGHT\"]/deadCrew/choice[3]/text"
msgstr "Set up a distress beacon and leave."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1388
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CARETAKER_FIGHT\"]/deadCrew/choice[3]/event/text"
msgstr ""
"You setup a distress beacon on the wreck and try to remove any evidence of "
"your presence before leaving as quickly as possible."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1391
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_CARETAKER_FIGHT\"]/deadCrew/choice[3]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1401
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/destroyed/text"
msgstr ""
"The pirate ship hails you one last time before it goes up in flames. \"No..."
" Our illegally downloaded media collection...\""

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1405
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//ship[@name=\"SHIP_OE_ACID_DIGITAL_PIRACY\"]/deadCrew/text"
msgstr ""
"With the Acidic crew of the pirate vessel dead, you manage to gain access to its digital storage, where you discover a hundred petabytes worth of pirated media, including movies, tv shows, radio dramas, music albums, live concert recordings, textbooks, proprietary applications, and one copy of \"A Very Slimy Christmas\" - a slug rendition of \"A Christmas Carol\" where Scrooge finds out that capital was, in fact, the only thing to live for and he, actually, never did anything particularly wrong.\n"
"\n"
"Deciding that piracy is evil in any form it might be presented, you decide to erase the contents of the drive, saving theoretical shareholders some theoretical value."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1414
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_OE_ACID_ELITE\"]/text"
