"You're still not sure if killing Acidic mechs counts as murder. Either way, "
"losing an elite vessel like that has to hurt the Acidic Growth."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1417
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_OE_ACID_ELITE\"]/choice/text"
msgstr "Continue..."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1419
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"DEFEAT_OE_ACID_ELITE\"]/choice/event/text"
msgstr ""
"It seems the cargo of the Elite Acidic ship survived the fight. Inside is a "
"functional weapon, which you bring back on board."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1457
