"find the root system for one of their Life Bloom systems, you could install "
"it in your own ship."

#: src-en/data/events_special_oe_acid.xml:1473
msgid ""
"data/events_special_oe_acid.xml$//event[@name=\"NEBULA_STORM_OE_ACID_AUGITEM_WIN\"]/choice[@req=\"oe_growth\""
